ble=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd1-n-log-jb"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n-log-jb-l1" value="jabatan_id 0..1" style="edgeLabel;resizable=0;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=bottom;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" connectable="0" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd1-n-log-jb"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-8" y="-2" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n1" value="&lt;b&gt;Notasi&lt;/b&gt; (Wazlawick 2024, §13.6; UML)&lt;br&gt;• Segitiga kosong ungu = generalisasi; di Odoo &lt;code&gt;_inherit = [mixin, …]&lt;/code&gt;. Kelas ungu «AbstractModel» tidak punya tabel sendiri.&lt;br&gt;• Panah terbuka = asosiasi &lt;b&gt;berarah&lt;/b&gt; (dapat dinavigasi dari pemilik field): Many2one atau Many2many. Label = nama field.&lt;br&gt;• Belah ketupat hitam = komposisi: One2many di induk + Many2one di anak (dua arah, anak ikut terhapus).&lt;br&gt;• Garis putus-putus = asosiasi turunan (field &lt;code&gt;compute&lt;/code&gt;). Garis polos tanpa panah = dua arah (One2many + Many2one).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;code&gt;+&lt;/code&gt; publik, &lt;code&gt;#&lt;/code&gt; internal (diawali garis bawah di Odoo). «override» = method warisan yang diisi ulang. {abstract} = wajib diisi turunan. @model = method kelas (&lt;code&gt;@api.model&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;br&gt;• Referensi ke model bawaan Odoo (res.users, ir.attachment, res.currency) ditulis sebagai atribut bertipe." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1180" width="760" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n2" value="&lt;b&gt;Dari conceptual model ke desain&lt;/b&gt; (§13.6: struktur boleh berubah)&lt;br&gt;• Generalisasi &lt;i&gt;DokumenTerkendali&lt;/i&gt; (CM-1) → &lt;code&gt;controlled.mixin&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;approval.mixin&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Tujuh konsep riwayat (Pengajuan, Penarikan, Pemeriksaan, Pengembalian, BerkasTTD, Pengesahan, Pencabutan) → &lt;b&gt;satu&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;labfik.approval.log&lt;/code&gt; dengan field &lt;code&gt;kejadian&lt;/code&gt; dan &lt;code&gt;putaran&lt;/code&gt;. Field ringkas di mixin menyimpan keadaan terakhir untuk tampilan cepat.&lt;br&gt;• Peran asosiasi (penyusun, pengesah, pencatat, …) → field Many2one dengan nama yang sama." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="1180" width="560" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n3" value="&lt;b&gt;Template Method&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;code&gt;action_sahkan()&lt;/code&gt; di mixin selalu menjalankan urutan tetap: cek wewenang (AB-02) → cek berkas TTD (AB-03) → cek pemeriksaan (AB-09) → ubah status → catat log → panggil &lt;code&gt;_setelah_disahkan()&lt;/code&gt;. Model turunan hanya mengisi hook itu:&lt;br&gt;• Versi: versi lama → diganti, jadwal tinjau (AB-04, AB-08)&lt;br&gt;• SK: SK lama → diganti, penugasan berlaku&lt;br&gt;• Rencana: rencana sejenis periode sama → diganti (AB-14)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="1180" width="560" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd1-n4" value="Design class diagram (masuk proposal). Diturunkan dari conceptual model (CM-1–3) + katalog operasi SSD. Rincian: rancangan/design-class-tata-kelola.md · Draf 13 Nov 2026 · Febriyan" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1340" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="tk-dcd2" name="DCD (2-3) Struktur dan Dokumen"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1860" pageHeight="1026" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-title" value="DCD 2/3 · Design class diagram: struktur organisasi (PKG-03) dan pengendalian dokumen (PKG-02)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1700" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-per" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.personel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Personel [M] [KONFIRMASI]&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="110" width="260" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-per-a" value="+ name: Char&lt;br&gt;+ jenis: Selection&lt;br&gt;+ user_id: res.users [0..1]&lt;br&gt;+ active: Boolean = True" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-per"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="260" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asl" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.assignment.line&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Baris Penetapan&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="268" width="240" height="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-asl-a" value="+ tanggal_mulai: Date&lt;br&gt;+ tanggal_selesai: Date" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-asl"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="240" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-mee" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.meeting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Rapat Koordinasi [T]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#6C4A87'&gt;{inherit: evidence}&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=55;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="396" width="260" height="108" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-mee-a" value="+ agenda: Text&lt;br&gt;+ keputusan: Html&lt;br&gt;+ notulen: Html" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="tk-dcd2-mee"><mxGeometry x="0" y="55" width="260" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tk-dcd2-jab" value="&lt;b&gt;labfik.jabatan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;Jabatan [M]&lt;/font&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;m